  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Bengaluru: Genomics diagnostic firm, <a href=\"/tag/medgenome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MedGenome</a> has launched <a href=\"/tag/oncotrack+mrd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OncoTrack MRD</a>, a blood test designed using a patient’s own tumour tissue to detect residual disease and help in earlier identification of potential cancer relapse.According to MedGenome, OncoTrack MRD is a personalised, tumor-informed, <a href=\"/tag/molecular+residual+disease+test\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">molecular residual disease test</a> for patients previously diagnosed with cancer.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>It is tailored to each patient using their own tumor tissue and analyzes circulating tumor DNA to detect and measure residual cancer, identify potential recurrence earlier than conventional methods, and support treatment decisions, the firm added.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The test can be performed multiple times a year and enables clinicians to monitor relapse throughout the course of cancer care, as well as provides insights into residual disease and treatment response and can help identify the risk of recurrence earlier.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>It is available nationwide with convenient home sample collection.The test was launched by oncologists Dr. Niti Raizada, Dr. Vinayak Maka, and Dr. Rajeev Vijayakumar, along with Rampasad Vedam, PhD, CEO, MedGenome Labs Ltd in Bengaluru.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Sep 4, 2026 at 07:09 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Sep 4, 2026 at 07:09 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon